ind":"update","title":"NO MAN'S MINES - Demo Update v0.4.0","summary":"It's been a while.This is a big one. The demo has changed quite a bit since the last version.For now, No Man's Mines is focused on survival crafting on Verdara, the first planet in the game. You crash-land with nothing and spend your time digging, gathering, building, fighting and surviving on foot.The ship, space travel, warp, pirates and ship modules are not part of the demo right now, but they're still part of the bigger plan.Later on, you'll be able to build your own ship piece by piece, wal","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-22T14:56:46Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010504453","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:50:07Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4926180-1840310314345921","game_id":"steam-4926180","kind":"announcement","title":"Working on the character creator","summary":"","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-07T18:48:02Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314345921","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:50:07Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4926180-1839041357024849","game_id":"steam-4926180","kind":"update","title":"The Future of No Man's Mines & Upcoming Big Demo Update!","summary":"Hey guys! I wanted to share a quick announcement about the future direction of No Man's Mines and when you can expect the next Demo update to land.Direction of the GameAfter working on the game for a while, I’ve decided not to go down the path of typical \"incremental mining\" games with generic upgrade trees. Instead, I’m pushing the game much further into the survival and exploration genre!Since I am also planning to add co-op in the future (hopefully before the 1.0 release!), this survival focu","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-22T18:54:30Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839041357024849","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:50:07Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4926180-1838407329262138","game_id":"steam-4926180","kind":"update","title":"NO MAN'S MINES - Demo Update v0.3.0","summary":"This is the biggest update the demo has received so far.The game has been completely reworked with a new stylized art direction, a brand new UI, a redesigned warp system, and ship modules that let you customize your ship with randomized loot.As always, thank you to everyone who played the demo and shared feedback!A whole new lookThe game has been given a complete visual overhaul.New hand-painted, stylized environments.Toon lighting across the entire game.Improved skies with painted nebulae, anim","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-18T15:30:52Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1838407329262138","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:50:07Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4926180-1837955055366966","game_id":"steam-4926180","kind":"update","title":"NO MAN'S MINES - Demo Update v0.2.0","summary":"The biggest addition in this update is a fully playable first-person cockpit. Alongside that, there's a new toolbelt system, a Signature Scanner, improved controls, and plenty of fixes based on your feedback.Thanks to everyone who played the demo and reported bugs. It really helps!Fly from the cockpitPress V while piloting to switch to the cockpit view.You now fly your ship from inside the cabin, complete with working dashboard displays showing your ship status, flight information, and navigatio","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-14T19:35:46Z","time_precision":"minute","sourc